OL,3,GNEWSAMP says district council has 'lost
OL,4,Amoral compass'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Nottinghamshire MP has called on the
OL,7,Fgovernment to step in over the running
OL,8,Fof a local council.
OL,10,FMichelle Welsh, whose Sherwood seat
OL,11,Fincludes part of Ashfield District
OL,12,FCouncil's area, said she was "outraged"
OL,13,Fand "disgusted" by the appointment of
OL,14,Fformer leader Jason Zadrozny to the
OL,15,Fplanning committee.
OL,17,FLast month, he was found guilty of
OL,18,Ffraud and tax evasion linked to a fake
OL,19,Fheritage group and property he owned.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
