OL,3,GNEWSAMP says district council has 'lost
OL,4,Amoral compass'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWelsh said there were wider problems at
OL,7,Fthe council and the appointment was "an
OL,8,Fabsolute slap in the face" for
OL,9,Fresidents.
